 * Two local relation schemas with distinct ids share a label and endpoint types, so
 * one incoming triple schema matches both. The case row expects every other relation
 * to still import. Only discovery, settings reads, Roam lookups and block writes are
 * mocked; schema matching and the instance loop are the real importSharedRelations.
 */
